Package: motionwall
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-glib-2.0, python3-xlib, mpv, ffmpeg
Recommends: gnome-shell (>= 45)
Description: animated video wallpaper for GNOME
 Motionwall plays any video file (MP4, MKV, WebM, MOV, GIF) as the desktop
 background. On GNOME Wayland a bundled GNOME Shell extension renders the video
 in the desktop's own background layer, behind every window and the desktop
 icons; on Xorg a lightweight daemon does the same with desktop-layer windows.
 .
 Video uses GPU decoding when available. Playback can pause when the screen is
 locked, the user is idle or full-screen applications cover the desktop.
 The Xorg daemon also supports battery pausing. Ships a GTK4/libadwaita settings window, a command
 line interface and a D-Bus API.
